# Build context for the api-server, evaluation-server, and control-plane images is this directory
# (`modules/`), not the individual module directories, because all three reference the shared
# projects under `modules/shared/`. Everything excluded here is excluded from all three builds.

# Folders
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/deploy/
.idea/

# The UI builds from its own context (`modules/front-end`), so this one never needs it — and
# node_modules is large enough that including it would dominate the context upload for a local
# `docker build`. (CI sends a git-tree context, where node_modules is absent anyway.)
front-end/
front-end-v1/
**/node_modules/

# Files
**/global.json
*.user
.dockerignore*
.gitignore
README.md
